3a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东斋杂咏 老槐","author":"张耒","text":"雪霜未死阅年华，危叶萧萧战古槎。\n袅袅秋风官舍冷，半枝斜日带啼鸦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":50906,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东斋杂咏 皂荚","author":"张耒","text":"畿县尘埃不可论，故山乔木尚能存。\n不缘去垢须青荚，自爱苍鳞百岁根。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":50907,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东斋杂咏 南窗","author":"张耒","text":"门前尘土慵驱马，堂上文书厌坐曹。\n只有南窗慰人意，寒灯清夜读离骚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":50908,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东斋杂咏 盆池","author":"张耒","text":"点点青萍秋后衰，溶溶晴日见鱼儿。\n水边窥影何方客，自照行吟憔悴姿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":50909,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东斋杂咏 菊","author":"张耒","text":"野人斋爨屏膻腥，自向阶前撷紫茎。\n老去爱花心转薄，一杯蔬饭足浮生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":50910,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东斋杂咏 道榻","author":"张耒","text":"纸阁芦帘小榻安，一裘容易却轻寒。\n谁惊午枕江湖梦，风落晴窗柏子乾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":50911,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东海旅夜二首 其二","author":"张耒","text":"兰釭背壁影微微，千里天涯客梦归。\n一夜海风声不断，晓来寒叶满庭飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":50912,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东海旅夜二首 其一","author":"张耒","text":"无酒消忧寒未减，隔帷相对一灯愁。\n虫声唤觉五更梦，风雨满庭桐叶秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":50913,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东堂四首 其四","author":"张耒","text":"乌衣更士能呼旦，金缕娇娘解唱歌。\n天与旅人供一笑，不然奈此寂寥何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":50914,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东堂四首 其三","author":"张耒","text":"居止年来如传舍，构堂珍重主人情。\n浮生行止谁能计，苟合真须学子荆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":50915,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东堂四首 其二","author":"张耒","text":"老翁还作小儿情，手种芭蕉为雨声。\n便有微泉出堂下，一泓清彻照轩楹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":50916,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东堂四首 其一","author":"张耒","text":"主人怜客置东堂，为致炎天十步凉。\n胜事自来非力致，江南山色巧相望。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":50917,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"乍晴二首 其二","author":"张耒","text":"虹长饮雨川无滴，蘋末生风沼有波。\n一扫烟云不知处，夜天如水泻银河。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":50918,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"乍晴二首 其一","author":"张耒","text":"洗来桐叶晚青青，积雨阑干暗菌生。\n墙角半倾苔晕合，萧萧风草一蛩鸣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":50919,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"代嘲","author":"张耒","text":"过作抛人去，非真我独知。\n如何立不定，却有独来时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":50920,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"写情二首 其一","author":"张耒","text":"墙外谁家桃李开，何由花下一徘徊。\n先教飞絮传愁去，却遣游丝取蕊来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":50921,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"冬日","author":"张耒","text":"忽忽新冬无一旬，自怜憔悴楚江滨。\n满前魑魅何曾禦，尚愧无功作逐臣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":50922,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"冬日怀竟陵管氏梅桥四首 其四","author":"张耒","text":"堂下幽芳自可人，北风一为屏埃尘。\n上元簪珥玲珑玉，却曳青霞霜女裙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":50923,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"冬日怀竟陵管氏梅桥四首 其三","author":"张耒","text":"他日华陵迹已陈，嘉辰怀旧一销魂。\n小园幽径谁相念，应有新梅觅故人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":50924,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"冬日怀竟陵管氏梅桥四首 其二","author":"张耒","text":"小小园林点点梅，如今绰约为谁开。\n只应清夜新霜里，依旧横斜倒影来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":50925,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"冬日怀竟陵管氏梅桥四首 其一","author":"张耒","text":"旅居泽国小园林，千里相望岁暮心。\n想见竟陵残雪里，新梅点雪橘垂金。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":50926,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"冬至赠潘郎二首 其二","author":"张耒","text":"五更人语起江城，歌笑喧喧天欲明。\n酌酒寿君但一醉，百年珍重是人情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":50927,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"冬至赠潘郎二首 其一","author":"张耒","text":"荻篱茅屋柯山下，卖饼归来也作冬。\n不见长安竞时节，车如流水马如龙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":50928,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"出京寄无咎二首 其二","author":"张耒","text":"老去相看情益亲，河梁分手欲沾巾。\n祇应诵得离骚赋，长作行吟去国人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":50929,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"出京寄无咎二首 其一","author":"张耒","text":"不许多闻长乐钟，打包旦遇又匆匆。\n长安城里谁相识，只有周南太史公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":50930,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"北风","author":"张耒","text":"北风卷地寒侵骨，冻雪连山鸟不飞。\n试问朱门馀酒肉，几人回首念无衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":50931,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"发孝感","author":"张耒","text":"袅袅樯乌转晚空，娟娟霜月入窗栊。\n岸头杨柳如怜客，犹舞萧萧五两风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":50932,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"发金陵折柳亭二首 其二","author":"张耒","text":"瞿昙昔教我，林下一宵行。\n何事春江上，依依作俗情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":50933,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"发金陵折柳亭二首 其一","author":"张耒","text":"匆匆十日事，回首亦凄凉。\n何处无芳草，行人休断肠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":50934,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]